      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present 4 Cypress Grove North, Templeogue, Dublin 6W to the market a superb four bedroom, two bathroom semi-detached family home with an attached garage, ideally positioned within one of Templeogue's most mature and highly sought-after residential developments. This prestigious location is renowned for its peaceful, tree-lined surroundings and exceptional convenience. Residents are spoiled for choice with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and local shops nearby, while Templeogue Village, Terenure Village and Rathfarnham Shopping Centre are all within easy reach. The area is particularly popular with families thanks to its abundance of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, together with excellent sporting and recreational facilities. Bushy Park is just a short distance away, while excellent public transport links and convenient access to the M50 ensure seamless connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nBright and generously proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c. 132 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, living room, dining room, fully fitted kitchen, four well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms. The property also benefits from an attached garage, providing excellent storage and further potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\nNo. 4 is presented as a fantastic blank canvas and is in need of modernisation throughout, offering the successful purchaser a wonderful opportunity to renovate and create a superb family home tailored to their own taste and requirements. Externally, the property boasts a private driveway providing ample off-street parking, while to the rear lies a large sunny garden laid in lawn, offering excellent outdoor space and significant potential for extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\n\nComing to the market with the added benefit of no onward chain, No. 4 represents a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in one of Dublin 6W's most desirable locations. Combining generous accommodation, exceptional potential and an unrivalled setting, this property is sure to appeal to growing families seeking a forever home. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0861304080 or 012241630 to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 132 sqm\n• BER E\n• 4 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Semi detached home\n• Off street parking\n• Oil heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Sunny large rear garden\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• No onwards chain\n• Ideal for growing families and those looking for their forever home\n• Viewing highly advised\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D6W KX27"
      },
      {
